{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1475324-aberrant-environmental-anima","id":1475324,"title":"[Aberrant] Environmental anima","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-23T09:05:37-08:00","id":1475324,"title":"[Aberrant] Environmental anima","content":"This power allows you to change the environment to harass your enemies.<br /> It can create barriers to movement, complications or environmental damage.<br /> Also it can reduce complications or environmental damage.<br /> <br /> I have some doubts:<ul><li>It has a medium range, but not defined area. This means that you can affect one person within medium range or everyone within medium range of you?</li> <li>It says that dot allocations are fixed once chosen. This means that you choose the dot allocations when you buy the power, or when you use the power?</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25829-vjornin","name":"Vjornin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-23T11:12:59-08:00","id":1475335,"title":"","content":"Think it like Storm controlling the weather, she can cause a lot of chaos all around the reach of the power, so can do this power, raise a windfall that hold people from moving or shooting through, create a blizzard to freeze the entire field, etc.<br /> <br /> The idea is the dots have this 3 possible effects and unless you have the variable tag (I don\u2019t recall the name exactly) you can\u2019t mix and match then.<br /> <br /> Those are my understanding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-23T11:20:23-08:00","id":1475336,"title":"","content":"my personal tak to both:<br /> 1) Medium is the actual area. In my understanding, you can place your barriers/complications/whatever anywhere inside this radius - and for powers described as actual wather effects (say, blizzard cold, strong winds, etc) these would affect everyone inside said radius.<br /> <br /> 2) chosen when you buy it (so, by default, it would be something like &quot;I generate walls of ice&quot; [Barriers] or &quot;I generate enough ambient cold to damage people&quot; [Damage]). To be able to choose everytime you use it, you need that special Tag described in the power (that would be &quot;I can create any ice-based environmental effects&quot; [each time you use it you allocate your points between barriers, damage, complications, etc]).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-23T19:43:06-08:00","id":1475386,"title":"","content":"Each dot you buy is dedicated to one thing. So your first dot could be a barrier and your second dot could be complications and then you buy a third dot and can get a second dot in barrier. Your fourth dot could be damage. So forth and so on.<br /> It is best to get Variable Tag with it. It really is.<br /> <br /> Also, it has been discovered that, as long as you have a high enough Cunning, can use all three options when it is your turn since there is no dice pool involved in usage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}